    lines.append('')
    lines.append('## Sun-compatible structure')
    lines.append('')
    lines.append('The dcap_like_sun family keeps a mild central z layer and expands scale mainly through the number of independent local x-blocks. Once z is fixed, all x-blocks can be solved independently.')
